  "message": "I’m happy to help! To get started, I need to verify your account. Please provide the email on your account (preferred). If you’re unsure, share your first and last name and your ZIP code instead. Also, let me know what you’d like to do with your recent orders (e.g., cancel or modify a pending order, return or exchange a delivered order, or update your address)."
}
